  "provenance": "Official. Zip linked from RoboMaster announcement 1785 \"关于RoboMaster 新电池及配套产品信息情况的说明\" (item ① 新电池外壳和RoboMaster 电池架2图纸). The same three STEP files are attached to the official RoboMaster wiki page \"电池架 2 Battery Rack 2\"; all three MD5s match the wiki listing (battery_rack 62fb1f68..., battery_asm f795cdca..., battery 3ddff7b3...). STEP header: Creo Parametric 2019, author harry.weng, 2024-11-07.",
  "license": "No explicit license. Published free by the RoboMaster organizing committee (DJI) for participant teams to design robots around the part; DJI copyright. Fine for rendering on our own site; do not redistribute the raw CAD file without checking with DJI/RoboMaster.",
  "dims_mm": {
    "overall_body": "92.00 x 66.90 x 51.15 (L x W x H; manual 4-view drawing, excludes the XT60 lead)",
    "front_view": "width 61.00, height 51.15; 4x M3 on 61.00 x 36.00",
    "side_view": "6x M3 on 73.00 x 36.00",
    "bottom_view": "4x M3 on 48.00 x 73.00",
    "thread": "M3, 6 mm thread depth; threaded holes on five faces; use at least 3 screws",
    "xt60_lead": "black/red wire pair to an XT60 plug; CAD lead extends about 127.8 mm beyond the body (CAD only, not an official spec)",
    "ports": "power output port D (black, GND) and E (red, +); battery info port 3-pin A=GND, B=SDA, C=SCL (top to bottom); battery status LED on the frame"
  },
  "mass_g": 130,
