  "notes": "Battery Rack 2 is the 2025+ rack for the RoboMaster \"new battery\" (DJI Matrice 4D Series battery, BPX230-6768-22.14); it replaced the original Battery Rack (TB47/TB48, 85 g, product 144/2570, which has its own STEP and is a different part). Specs: 130 g, XT60 output, 35 A max continuous, I2C address 0x41 at 100 kHz. Price RMB 165 (official page). There is no English product page (5661 is an empty placeholder). The rack STEP is a full assembly including PCBs and SMD parts (53 products); for a stylised render you may want to drop the tiny SMD bodies."
}